  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>I</strong>nstall: Clinic</p>\n<p><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 7 (2d6)</p>\n<p><em>A coprocessor to support decision-making processes in emergencies.</em></p>\n<p>Neuralware. Requires at least one installation of Speedware. When the user enters the Seriously Wounded Wound State, they can activate this cyberware without an Action. When activated, the user’s current Initiative is increased by 2 until the end of their next Turn. This cyberware has a 1 hour cooldown before it can be activated again.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Neuralware<br>\n<strong>Install:</strong> Clinic<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 1</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The effect raises initiative by 2 while toggled on; switch it off at the end of the next Turn.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
